Dataset Access and Usage Policy

We are committed to making the TCDEED dataset publicly available free of charge for academic and research purposes. However, due to technical difficulties associated with uploading large files to GitHub, the dataset is not yet available for direct download. We are working to resolve this issue and will make the dataset accessible through a public download link as soon as possible.

In the meantime, researchers interested in accessing the dataset may contact us via email at **[your email address]**. Please include a signed statement confirming that the dataset will be used exclusively for non-commercial academic and research purposes and will not be used for any commercial activities or profit-making purposes. Upon receiving the request and the signed statement, we will provide the dataset via email.

We appreciate your interest in the TCDEED dataset and thank you for your understanding and support.



